{'symbol': 'ROL', 'date': '2023-04-25 17:12:00', 'title': 'ROLLINS, INC. ANNOUNCES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ATLANTA, APRIL 25, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- ROLLINS, INC. (NYSE:ROL), A PREMIER GLOBAL CONSUMER AND COMMERCIAL SERVICES COMPANY ANNOUNCED THAT THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND ON ITS COMMON STOCK OF $0.13 PER SHARE PAYABLE JUNE 9, 2023 TO STOCKHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON MAY 10, 2023.\xa0 THIS REPRESENTS AN INCREASE OF 30 PERCENT FROM THE SAME QUARTER A YEAR AGO.'}